            "body": "<p>Earn 10% of the total sale price, including VAT, on every eligible purchase attributed to you. Your contact pays the usual advertised price.</p><p><strong>Example</strong><br>On a completed sale of £2,000 including VAT, you earn £200.</p><p><strong>Best for</strong><br>Affiliates who want to maximise their earnings.</p>"
