            "body": "<p>Prefer to pass on the full benefit? Choose not to receive commission and give your friends, family, followers and contacts an exclusive 10% discount instead.</p><p><strong>Example</strong><br>On a £2,000 purchase, your contact saves £200 and pays £1,800. You receive no commission.</p><p><strong>Best for</strong><br>Anyone who simply wants to help the people they know buy something special for less.</p>"
