    "faq": {
      "type": "fye-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Who can become a For Your Eternity affiliate?",
            "a": "<p>We welcome applications from existing customers, content creators, bloggers, wedding professionals, businesses, community organisers and people who simply love recommending us to friends and family. You do not need a large online following. Every application is reviewed to make sure the partnership is a good fit.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What are the three reward options?",
            "a": "<p>You can earn 10% commission while your contact pays the usual price; earn 5% commission while giving them 5% off; or receive no commission and give them the full 10% discount. You do not have to pick one and stick with it: on approval you receive a referral link and two discount codes which between them cover all three, so you choose as you go.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Is commission really calculated including VAT?",
            "a": "<p>Yes. Commission is calculated on the eligible sale price including VAT. With the 5% + 5% option, the customer's discount and your commission are both calculated from the price before the affiliate discount is deducted. On a £2,000 purchase, they save £100 and you earn £100.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How is a sale linked to me?",
            "a": "<p>Sales are tracked through your personalised affiliate link or code. The person you refer should use your link, enter your code or quote it when they first contact us. This is particularly important if their purchase involves a consultation or a bespoke design process.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "When will I receive my commission?",
            "a": "<p>Commission is approved after an eligible order has been paid in full, completed and passed any applicable cancellation or returns period. Your dashboard will show the status of referred orders. The payment schedule and method are explained in the <a href=\"/pages/affiliate-terms\">Affiliate Programme Terms</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What happens if an order is cancelled, returned or refunded?",
            "a": "<p>Commission is only payable on the value of a completed sale that For Your Eternity retains. Cancelled or fully refunded orders do not earn commission. If an order is partially refunded, commission is recalculated to reflect the remaining eligible sale value.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q7": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Can affiliate discounts be combined with other offers?",
            "a": "<p>Affiliate discounts cannot normally be combined with another discount or promotional code unless we expressly state otherwise. The customer will receive the most appropriate eligible offer available to them.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q8": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Do I have to pick one reward option?",
            "a": "<p>No. You are given a referral link and two discount codes covering all three options, so you can use whichever suits each conversation. Whatever the customer used at the point of sale is what applies to that order; it cannot be changed afterwards.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
